; The ordinary-OCaml half of ppx_windtrap: generated code and the
; inline_tests backend's runner address it as
; Ppx_windtrap_runtime.Ppx_runtime — the wrapped library name is the
; spelling, so windtrap's internal module layout stays out of generated
; code. It consumes the core through Windtrap.Private; the alias block
; at the top of ppx_runtime.ml is the census of that diet.

(library
 (name ppx_windtrap_runtime)
 (public_name ppx_windtrap.runtime)
 ; unix: the undriven-registration guard records the installing pid and
 ; fires only in that process — a test that forks must not see the
 ; parent's diagnostic repeated by a child's exit (the core exit guard's
 ; own defense). No new dependency weight: windtrap already links unix.
 (libraries windtrap unix)
 ; The core measures its own coverage, and Ppx_runtime moved out of it;
 ; keeping the backend keeps the measured set intact. No mutation
 ; stanza, deliberately: the runtime is part of the machinery that
 ; judges mutants, and a mutant armed inside the judging process hangs
 ; — ppx_runtime.ml's [@@@mutate exclude_file] states the same intent
 ; in-file. Inert without --instrument-with.
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage)))
